  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Ta chọn hệ tọa độ sao cho parabol <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>   <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Thay tọa độ điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>50</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> vào phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, ta được <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>50</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>625</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tKhi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>625</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Thay tọa độ điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>;</mo><mn>18</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> vào phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, ta được <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>18</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>625</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1944</mn><mn>625</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1104</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tVậy chiều dài của thanh cách điểm giữa cầu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>18</mn></semantics></math> m là <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1104</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1104</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (m).</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></div></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/33cdb1d1ca79308ae215d8a093cfca31552c1bd19096980bcb927c553bfd8ac1.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
